     "explanation": "**De Brevitate Vitae** (*On the Shortness of Life*), an earlier essay to Paulinus, develops the thesis that *\"life is long enough if it were all well invested.\"* Letter 1, written more than a decade later, **compresses** that argument into a single intimate imperative to Lucilius: *vindica te tibi*. The essay diagnoses the social disease of squandered time; the letter prescribes the personal cure.",
