     "explanation": "The whole seminar collapses to one Senecan injunction: **begin tomorrow, with one specific practice, done daily**. Not all six. Not after more reading. Not after announcing it. One practice, scheduled, done, logged honestly, repeated for 30 days. This is the entire engine. Reading every letter without doing one practice is the Calvisius Sabinus mistake. Doing one practice for 30 days, even imperfectly, is more philosophy than most people do in their lives.",
